+// Four list entries in flight per iteration.  The chain here is
+// list-entry -> block load -> body, and one entry at a time keeps a single
+// uint4 outstanding per thread, which is the same memory-latency cap the
+// block-hist walk buys out of with its four-adjacent-block loop: the measured
